  "bodyHash": "9e7fe40ed37d03a2",
  "content": "\n\n<p>本模組旨在提升戰鬥體驗與角色數值。神器可提供數值加成，包括攻擊力、生命值、護甲、移動速度，甚至攻擊範圍與攻擊速度。透過擊殺高血量怪物（包含其他模組的頭目與精英怪物）可獲得神器，並可透過餵食其他神器來進行升級。成套裝備時會觸發實用的套裝效果，在執行特定戰術時提供巨大加成。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Discord:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/BCHNhsDMXz\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/BCHNhsDMXz</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>依賴模組</strong>：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2library\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Library</a></p>\n<p><strong><strong>選用依賴：</strong></strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-complements\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Complements</a>&nbsp;（僅安裝此模組後方可製作終局物品）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/831/188/screen-shot-2024-03-24-at-22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"334\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/831/189/screen-shot-2024-03-24-at-22.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"279\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/867/353/page3.png\" width=\"500\" height=\"279\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>玩法說明：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/590/7/main.png\" width=\"1708\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/590/8/filter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1708\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/590/9/dismantle.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1708\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/590/10/upgrade.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1708\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/590/11/stat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1708\" height=\"960\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/590/13/effect.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1708\" height=\"960\"><br><br></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>查看我們的其它模組：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-backpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Backpack</a>：背包、大量物品儲存與遠程運輸功能</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modulargolems\" rel=\"nofollow\">ModularGolems</a>：類似《創世小玩家》的高度自訂義傀儡，適用於戰鬥與刷怪塔</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-complements\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Complements</a>：終局材料、裝備、附魔與藥水</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2weaponry\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Weaponry</a>：多種近戰武器、投擲武器與盾牌，各自具備特殊能力</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2-archery\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Archery</a>：多種弓與箭矢，各自具備特殊能力</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l2hostility\" rel=\"nofollow\">L2Hostility</a>：根據玩家實力動態調整強度的怪物強化模組。擊殺怪物可提升難度，死亡則降低難度。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curse-of-pandora\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse of Pandora</a>：多種護身符可串接成項鍊與手鐲以組合不同能力</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilights-flavors-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twilight's Flavors &amp; Delight</a>：採用暮色森林食材製作的《美食餐廚》風格料理，並新增拿坡里風味食物。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cuisine-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cuisine Delight</a>：憑藉您能想到的任何食材組合，烹調專屬餐盤料理</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fruits-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fruits Delight</a>：新增 11 種水果與 48 種食物，所有水果皆具獨立的食用效果</p>",
